on-arrival: red_renaissance_stage = 9; red_renaissance_active = 0; red_renaissance_withered = 1; red_renaissance_outcome = "The pre-party movement withered after a rapid mood reversal"; news_headline = "The rumoured socialist convergence loses its crowd before it can found a party"

= [+ date_label +] — The coaches are cancelled

The Kraków organiser cancels first, then Łódź and Wrocław. The Warsaw hall
wants its deposit before the draft statute exists. A month ago a national
demonstration looked like the next fact of Polish politics; now every argument
at the planning meeting is about whether the crowd will be large enough to
survive the photographs.

The organisations do not disappear. Union activists return to workplace
disputes, anarchist sections to mutual aid and anti-eviction work, and RSS to
its independent casework. What disappears is the claim that these activities
are about to become one national party.

[? if red_renaissance_identity = "Akcja Socjalistyczna": Preneta tells the
remaining Akcja Socjalistyczna groups that a cadre organisation can survive
without pretending it is a mass party.?]
[? if red_renaissance_identity = "Razem": Zandberg keeps Razem's independent
party, but the promised convergence around it never arrives.?]

- @red_wither_cells
- @red_wither_demands
- @red_wither_leave

@red_wither_cells
title: Keep legal-aid and tenant cells alive without a party launch
on-arrival: movement_autonomy += 4; organiser_energy += 2; union_trust += 1; red_renaissance_outcome = "The party launch withered; local aid cells survived"; news_headline = "The Red Renaissance contracts into local mutual-aid work"

The national name disappears. The useful phone trees do not. Nothing contests
an election, but the next eviction, wage theft case or dormitory sale meets a
slightly better organised response.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

@red_wither_demands
title: Bring the housing and workplace demands into our programme
on-arrival: labor_credibility += 2; progressive_credibility += 2; razem_dissent -= 3; public_trust += 1; red_renaissance_outcome = "The launch withered; Lewica absorbed part of its programme"; news_headline = "Lewica adopts demands left by the withered socialist convergence"

The party takes the demands and none of the rival organisation. Former
conveners call it proof that pressure works; our officials call it proof that a
second party was unnecessary.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

@red_wither_leave
title: Let the organisers disperse without a rescue operation
on-arrival: red_renaissance_outcome = "The movement withered without an institutional remnant"; barons_dissent -= 2; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "The Red Renaissance remains a season of rumours"

The hall is released, the domain expires and nobody needs to defeat the party
because nobody finished founding it. Six months later the coach spreadsheet
survives in three inboxes and nowhere else.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

@red_foundation
# prose-audit: Grade A — The founding is an actual congress with a statute, leadership vote and explicit boundaries between party, unions, anarchist federations, RSS and KSS.
title: A second party forms on the Left
subtitle: The demonstration's organisers vote on a statute, a leader and what remains outside
face-image: img/poland/events/union-march.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 30
order: 8
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and red_renaissance_stage = 1 and time >= red_renaissance_next_time and public_climate_progressive_index > red_renaissance_launch_index - 5 and public_climate_progressive_trend > -1.2
on-arrival: {!
const redOrganisation = Math.max(
    12,
    Math.round(
        (Number(Q.red_renaissance_strength) || 10) +
        (Number(Q.red_renaissance_city_network) || 0)
    )
);
Q.red_renaissance_stage = 2;
Q.red_renaissance_party_formed = 1;
Q.red_renaissance_next_time = (Number(Q.time) || 0) + 1;
Q.red_renaissance_outcome =
    Q.red_renaissance_identity + " becomes the Red Renaissance party";
if (Q.red_renaissance_identity == "Razem") {
    if (!Q.razem_party_formed) {
        const redRazemSeats = Math.max(
            0,
            Math.round(Number(Q.razem_seats) || 0)
        );
        const redRazemStrength = Math.max(
            redOrganisation,
            Number(Q.razem_strength) || 0
        );
        Q.razem_split = 1;
        Q.razem_split_outcome = "red_renaissance";
        Q.razem_party_formed = 1;
        Q.razem_opposition_circle = 1;
        Q.razem_active = 0;
        Q.razem_in_left = 0;
        Q.razem_in_left_club = 0;
        Q.left_seats = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) - redRazemSeats);
        Q.razem_party_seats =
            Math.max(0, Number(Q.razem_party_seats) || 0) + redRazemSeats;
        Q.razem_mp_departed =
            Math.max(0, Number(Q.razem_mp_departed) || 0) + redRazemSeats;
        Q.razem_exit_strength = redRazemStrength;
        Q.razem_strength = 0;
        Q.razem_dissent = 0;
        Q.zandberg_advisor = 0;
        Q.zawisza_advisor = 0;
        Q.matysiak_advisor = 0;
    }
    Q.razem_exit_strength = Math.max(
        Number(Q.razem_exit_strength) || 0,
        redOrganisation
    );
    Q.razem_party_relation = Math.min(
        Number(Q.razem_party_relation) || 24,
        28
    );
    Q.razem_poll_momentum =
        (Number(Q.razem_poll_momentum) || 0) + 1.2 +
        redOrganisation * 0.025;
    Q.razem_right_score = Math.min(18, Number(Q.razem_right_score) || 18);
} else {
    Q.tak_dla_rozwoju_party_formed = 1;
    Q.razem_successor_party_formed = 1;
    Q.akcja_socjalistyczna_party_formed = 1;
    Q.tak_dla_rozwoju_legal_party_formed = 0;
    Q.tak_rozwoj_party_name = "Akcja Socjalistyczna";
    Q.tak_rozwoj_leader = "Paweł Preneta";
    Q.tak_rozwoj_legal_status = "registered political party";
    Q.tak_rozwoj_list_committee = "tak_rozwoj";
    Q.tak_rozwoj_ai_active = 1;
    Q.tak_rozwoj_ai_strategy = "Build a movement socialist party";
    Q.tak_rozwoj_parent_relation = Math.min(
        Number(Q.tak_rozwoj_parent_relation) || 24,
        24
    );
    Q.razem_future_activists = Math.max(
        Number(Q.razem_future_activists) || 0,
        redOrganisation
    );
    Q.akcja_socjalistyczna_activists = Math.max(
        Number(Q.akcja_socjalistyczna_activists) || 0,
        redOrganisation
    );
    Q.akcja_socjalistyczna_credibility = Math.max(
        Number(Q.akcja_socjalistyczna_credibility) || 0,
        Math.round(
            (Number(Q.labor_credibility) || 0) * 0.35 +
            (Number(Q.progressive_credibility) || 0) * 0.35 +
            redOrganisation * 0.30
        )
    );
    Q.tak_rozwoj_right_score = 5;
    Q.tak_rozwoj_poll_momentum =
        (Number(Q.tak_rozwoj_poll_momentum) || 0) + 1.2 +
        redOrganisation * 0.025;
}
Q.red_renaissance_strength = redOrganisation;
Q.red_renaissance_voter_theft += Math.max(2, redOrganisation * 0.12);
Q.poll_state_month_key = -1;
Q.news_headline = Q.red_renaissance_identity +
    " becomes a party to Lewica's left";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — The temporary committee calls a vote

The delegates meet with three documents on every chair: a party statute, a
declaration of principles and a protocol defining what the party may never ask
of the organisations that brought people into the room. Campus and dormitory
groups may affiliate locally. Federacja Anarchistyczna remains its own
federation. IP and ZSP keep their membership lists, strike decisions and money
outside party control. RSS remains a supportive movement, not a subordinate
branch.

The boundary loses votes from people who wanted one disciplined organisation
and from people who wanted no party at all. It wins the congress. A national
party will contest elections; the unions, tenant groups and anarchist sections
will decide for themselves when to share its streets.

[? if red_renaissance_identity = "Akcja Socjalistyczna": <span class="party
party-name has-party-logo party-akcja-socjalistyczna"><span
class="party-name-logo" aria-hidden="true"></span><b>Akcja
Socjalistyczna</b></span> supplies its registered association, declaration and
regional groups. Delegates elect **Paweł Preneta** as national leader and put
**Łukasz Kozak** on the programme commission. The association's old question—
how to build a democratic socialist party—has acquired a bank account, a
membership form and an answer.?]
[? if red_renaissance_identity = "Razem": <span class="party
party-razem"><b>Razem</b></span> supplies the ballot line, national structure
and Adrian Zandberg's parliamentary authority. Paweł Preneta and Akcja
Socjalistyczna organisers join the broader convergence without lending its
name to a second party.?]

Ikonowicz endorses the vote and again refuses a party office. KSS casework
remains open to people who will never join. The separation gives the new party
a prominent supporter it cannot discipline and a public test it cannot fake:
whether speeches are followed by lawyers, strike funds and roofs.

The press calls it the **Red Renaissance** before the delegates do. Its adopted
programme goes beyond Razem's parliamentary offer: worker control, social
ownership of major firms, mass public housing, a shorter working week and an
ecological plan written around public investment. Its first resolution names
Lewica. We proved that a progressive programme can win; it says we stopped
where coalition government became comfortable.

- @red_foundation_deliver
- @red_foundation_blackout
- @red_foundation_spoiler

@red_foundation_deliver
title: Answer a socialist party with another year of visible delivery
subtitle: Make implementation the dividing line and accept criticism from the left.
on-arrival: {!
Q.red_renaissance_response = "Compete through delivery";
Q.public_trust += 3;
Q.labor_credibility += 2;
Q.left_poll_momentum += 0.25;
Q.red_renaissance_strength = Math.max(8, Q.red_renaissance_strength - 2);
if (Q.red_renaissance_identity == "Razem") {
    Q.razem_party_relation += 3;
    Q.razem_poll_momentum -= 0.2;
} else {
    Q.tak_rozwoj_parent_relation += 3;
    Q.tak_rozwoj_poll_momentum -= 0.2;
}
Q.poll_state_month_key = -1;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica answers the Red Renaissance with an implementation ledger";
!}

We call it what it is: a party to our left. Ministers and councillors receive a
monthly sheet containing the measure promised, the office responsible and the
date on which somebody outside government can use it. From now on coalition
partners will tell us we go too far while the new party publishes where we
stopped.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

@red_foundation_blackout
title: Deny a new fringe party national media oxygen
subtitle: Keep our studios and discover how much attention exclusion creates.
on-arrival: {!
Q.red_renaissance_response = "Media exclusion";
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.public_trust -= 2;
Q.red_renaissance_strength += 3;
if (Q.red_renaissance_identity == "Razem") Q.razem_poll_momentum += 0.8;
else Q.tak_rozwoj_poll_momentum += 0.8;
Q.poll_state_month_key = -1;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica tries to deny the Red Renaissance national airtime";
!}

Friendly producers receive a simple booking rule. Preneta or Zandberg publishes
each refusal with the invitation and proposed subject attached, then sells out
a public interview in the city where the booking was denied. We keep the studio
chair and lose the argument over who was afraid to fill it.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

@red_foundation_spoiler
title: Call them spoilers for risking every progressive reform
subtitle: Unite the apparatus against them and sharpen their reason to exist.
on-arrival: {!
Q.red_renaissance_response = "Spoiler attack";
Q.barons_dissent -= 3;
Q.party_unity += 2;
Q.young_support -= 2;
if (Q.razem_active) Q.razem_dissent += 4;
Q.red_renaissance_strength += 4;
if (Q.red_renaissance_identity == "Razem") {
    Q.razem_party_relation -= 10;
    Q.razem_poll_momentum += 1.1;
} else {
    Q.tak_rozwoj_parent_relation -= 10;
    Q.tak_rozwoj_poll_momentum += 1.1;
}
Q.poll_state_month_key = -1;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica declares the Red Renaissance a threat to progressive government";
!}

The warning reaches every regional office: a second list can put both below
their best result and return the right to office. The arithmetic is sound. So
is the reply printed on the new party's leaflets—that Lewica now talks about
progressive voters as property and coalition office as the reason they must
stay.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

@red_cities
# prose-audit: Grade A — Six branches are shown through premises, weekly work and inherited local campaigns; May Day determines who already knows how to move people between them.
title: Red rooms in six cities
subtitle: The movement converts demonstrations into branches, casework and a rival calendar
face-image: img/poland/events/union-march.webp
