We release the minutes, the coalition objections and the office responsible
for the next move. The document does not turn a missed promise into delivery.
It does prevent every partner from claiming that somebody else owns the delay,
and gives the march a date on which it can prove us wrong again.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

