The Interior Ministry moves the final assembly point away from the
Chancellery and holds the side streets behind cordons. The cabinet obtains an
orderly afternoon. By evening the party has two leaflets: the failure that
called the march and the government that decided not to see it at its door.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

