Every audience receives two columns: what entered law and what did not survive
the coalition or parliamentary count. Where implementation is real, the rival
must explain what replacing us would improve. Where a promise stalled, we have
printed its attack line and the responsible office for it.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

