!}

The moderator keeps the questions on public ownership, rents, labour law and
the transition out of private provision. We expose costs and missing votes;
they read back coalition vetoes and our protest record. Both parties leave
with a clearer case than the liberals who booked the programme for a quarrel.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

