The conference resolution commits Lewica to worker control and social
ownership in named sectors. The rival prints the resolution beside the
concessions already signed by our ministers. We recover programme ground and
open a harder internal question: whether the new words bind the next coalition
council or merely the next speech.

- @poland_event_queue: Return to the events desk

@red_razem_wavers
# prose-audit: Grade A — The split pressure arrives as branch motions, membership rules and a National Council agenda rather than a generic dissent counter.
title: Razem receives two membership motions
subtitle: Akcja's growth forces the internal socialist current to decide where organising ends and departure begins
